						 <span class="myTitle" style="display: none;">无明之渊</span><span class="myClass" style="display: none;">Euclid</span><span class="myPreview" style="display: none;">不存在之物突入存在之境，无逻辑之地染指秩序之国。</span> <div class="creditRate"> <div class="rateBox"> <div class="rate-box-with-credit-button"> <div class="creditButton"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>著作信息</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/4" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <p>本文作者为<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/meltyland-nightmare" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6167306&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608342870" alt="Meltyland Nightmare" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6167306)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/meltyland-nightmare" >Meltyland Nightmare</a></span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/erwin-schrodinger-s-personnel-files">首席研究员祖绫的人事页。</a><br /> 本文配图信息：<br /> SCP-CN-1899-B的配图为本人在青岛对着太阳拍摄的照片加了滤镜而成。<br /> 安保模因配图为公共资源：<a href="https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Apophysis-100303-104.jpg#mw-jump-to-license">https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Apophysis-100303-104.jpg#mw-jump-to-license</a></p> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> <div class="creditBottomRate" style="position:relative;height:30px;"> <div style="text-align: center; top: 0px;"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="orderwrapper"> <div class="council1"></div> <div class="ordertitle"> <h1><span>据监督者议会指示，该文件已被闭锁</span></h1> </div> <div class="orderdescription"><br /> <br /> <h1><span>下列文件被设为5/CN-1899级机密，该5级权限不包含在常规5级权限之中</span></h1> <p>依照O5-指令18994， 本文件内容限具5/CN-1899授权人员查阅。下列文件受五级机密保护，五级信息的泄露被严厉禁止，且将对SCP基金会及其利益造成严重威胁。访问文件的成员需提供五级许可。您当前的访问凭据是<strong><tt>#ID 18994 CHAOS LV/CRD: KFNR/31, NP1-3410/5+AKD, L4361+5/CN-1899</tt></strong>，且您最近的认知接种被编目于<tt>12/31</tt>发布。若访问许可不正确，请依照程序<strong><tt>11N-42-00</tt></strong>，退出终端，联系你的站点指挥官获取指示。</p> <h1><span>CN-1899</span></h1> </div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /></p> <p style="text-align: center;">安保模因已加载</p> <img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/erwin-schrodinger-s-personnel-files/ann" alt="ann" class="image" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <p style="text-align: center;">检测到生命体征</p> <p style="text-align: center;">正在打开文件</p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">•</span></p> </div> <hr /> <div class="cn cdver2" style="width: 100%;height: 0;padding-bottom: calc(50% / 3);background-position: center; background-size: contain; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22600%22%20height%3D%22100%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20600%20100%22%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3Cstyle%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3Erect%5Bfill*%3D%22b01%22%5D%20%7Banimation%3A%20blink%203s%20ease-in-out%20infinite%3B%7D%40keyframes%20blink%20%7B0%25%2C20%25%7Bfill-opacity%3A%201%3B%7D50%25%7Bfill-opacity%3A%200.75%3B%7D80%25%2C100%25%20%7Bfill-opacity%3A%201%3B%7D%7D%3C%2Fstyle%3E%3Cfilter%20id%3D%22