&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;myTitle&quot; style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;天堑&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;myClass&quot; style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;Thaumiel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;myPreview&quot; style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;人心惟危，道心惟微。惟精惟一，允执厥中。&lt;/span&gt;by [[*user ]]&lt;/p&gt;
