						 <span class="myTitle" style="display: none;">机械宇宙</span><span class="myClass" style="display: none;">Euclid</span><span class="myPreview" style="display: none;">机械隐藏在帷幕之前，齿轮啮合中宇宙演变。</span> <div class="creditRate"> <div class="rateBox"> <div class="rate-box-with-credit-button"> <div class="creditButton"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>著作信息</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/4" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <p>本文作者为<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/meltyland-nightmare" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6167306&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608342870" alt="Meltyland Nightmare" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6167306)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/meltyland-nightmare" >Meltyland Nightmare</a></span>，该作者的更多作品见<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/erwin-schrodinger-s-personnel-files">首席研究员祖绫的人事页。</a><br /> <strong>本文配图信息：</strong><br /> 安保模因配图为公共资源：<a href="https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Apophysis-100303-104.jpg#mw-jump-to-license">https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Apophysis-100303-104.jpg#mw-jump-to-license</a></p> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" 