&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/jijinhuidelinian&quot;&gt;基金会的理念&lt;/a&gt; By &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/adeptus-custodes&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3457409&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608342873&quot; alt=&quot;Adeptus Custodes&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3457409)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/adeptus-custodes&quot;  &gt;Adeptus Custodes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:华文楷体;font-size: 100%&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;我哑口无言，难道基金会崇高的工作就这么被否定了？控制收容保护真的只是我们一厢情愿？&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
