ass="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3354275&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608342873" alt="OlivaFute" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3354275)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/olivafute" >OlivaFute</a></span><br /></p> </div> <blockquote> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family:华文楷体;font-size: 100%"><em>世界仍未开始，此为序章。</em></span></p> </blockquote> <p><br /> <br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/fallen-world">陨落的世界</a> By <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/astra-glorice-sws" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3363881&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608342873" alt="Astra_Glorice_SWS" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3363881)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/astra-glorice-sws" >Astra_Glorice_SWS</a></span><br /></p> </div> <blockquote> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family:华文楷体;font-size: 100%"><em>陨落的永远是世界，堕落的永远是人心。</em></span></p> </blockquote> <p><br /> <br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/shamodercjl">沙漠的日常记录</a> By <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/knight-li-zx" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3267343&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608342873" alt="Knight Li ZX" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3267343)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/knight-li-zx" >Knight Li ZX</a></span><br /></p> </div> <blockquote> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family:华文楷体;font-size: 100%"><em>命不久矣。我不想死。</em></span></p> </blockquote> <p><br /> <br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/jijinhuidelinian">基金会的理念</a> By <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/adeptus-custodes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3457409&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608342873" alt="Adeptus Custodes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3457409)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/adeptus-custodes" >Adeptus Custodes</a></span><br /></p> </div> <blockquote> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family:华文楷体;font-size: 100%"><em>我哑口无言，难道基金会崇高的工作就这么被否定了？控制收容保护真的只是我们一厢情愿？</em></span></p> </blockquote> <p><br /> <br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-beloved-is-gone">所爱之人已逝</a>By <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/olivafute" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3354275&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608342873" alt="OlivaFute" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3354275)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/olivafute" >OlivaFute</a></span>&amp;<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/astra-glorice-sws" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3363881&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608342873" alt="Astra_Glorice_SWS" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3363881)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/astra-glorice-sws" >Astra_Glorice_SWS</a></span><br /></p> </div> <blockquote> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family:华文楷体;font-size: 100%"><em>爱自于他心，不可辨之虚实，人往心犹故。</em></span></p> </blockquote> <p><br /> <br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/catdanger">吟游诗人的笔录：危机猫</a> By <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/saopig" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3715193&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608342873" alt="saopig" 